From bbad9e0a0365280da344d7c46a95ac313b4dc55c Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: joebereczki <41107035-joebereczki@users.noreply.replit.com>
Date: Sun, 1 Mar 2026 02:05:38 +0000
Subject: [PATCH 162/244] Improve position closing by adding missing expiry
 field and ensuring size is a string

Correctly handle expiry and size for closing positions via API, and update static asset versions.

